  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme addressing unsafe irregular migration through and from Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forced migration and irregular migration are major areas of humanitarian concern in Ethiopia context. Through this programme FCDO intends to make a major investment towards reducing people&apos;s exposure to unsafe irregular migration from Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
